{"id":"939ed0c717cef4ab","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-topos-4.md","title":"df-topos-four","display":"df-topos-four","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-topos-4","aliases":["16-df-topos-4","Topos characterization by slices"],"display":"df-topos-four","depends_on":["[[16-df-lccc]]","[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[16-df-elementary-topos]]"],"source":"Theorem5.4.7 and Corollary5.4.8 pp.343–345 (PDF363–365)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-topos-4"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-topos-4</span><span>Topos characterization by slices</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-topos-four"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11ad48f63b554ca7\" href=\"?note=11ad48f63b554ca7\" title=\"16-df-lccc\">16-df-lccc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3744a99e6a5c0037\" href=\"?note=3744a99e6a5c0037\" title=\"16-df-elementary-topos\">16-df-elementary-topos</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem5.4.7 and Corollary5.4.8 pp.343–345 (PDF363–365)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{LCCC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubObjCl}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubObjCl}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\\)</span> 采用本页直接依赖。有限极限存在时固定同一终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Topos}_4\">\\(\\mathrm{Topos}_4\\)</span> 为下文定义的性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Topos}_4(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\bigl[\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal E(X,1))\\ h=h\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\exists\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists\\top\\in\\mathcal E(1,\\Omega))\\\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Topos}_4(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Topos}_4(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\bigl[\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal E(X,1))\\ h=h\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\exists\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists\\top\\in\\mathcal E(1,\\Omega))\\\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Topos}_4(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书Theorem5.4.7与Corollary5.4.8 pp.343–345 (PDF363–365)给初等拓扑斯的局部笛卡尔闭性。反向，LCCC的终切片 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E/1\">\\(\\mathcal E/1\\)</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span>，所以基范畴CCC；再结合有限极限及分类子即初等拓扑斯。分类数据的源靶及终对象在同一量词体绑定，不能用未声明的任意Ω、top。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-lccc","status":"resolved","id":"11ad48f63b554ca7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-lccc]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LCCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubObjCl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Topos}_4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Topos}_4(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&\\land(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\bigl[\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal E(X,1))\\ h=h\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\exists\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists\\top\\in\\mathcal E(1,\\Omega))\\\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Topos}_4(\\mathcal E)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal E/1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false}],"bytes":1512,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-topos-4|df-topos-four]]"}],"outgoing":["11ad48f63b554ca7","55e78399bad5fbe9","3744a99e6a5c0037"]}